<section>
  <div class="container" style="max-width:720px;">
    <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
    <h2>Common questions</h2>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>What size channel is this for?</summary>
      <p>Any size — from brand-new channels to established creators. Consulting applies whether you have 0 subscribers or 100,000. The advice is always tailored to where you are right now.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>Will you guarantee results?</summary>
      <p>No guarantees — anyone who promises that isn't being honest. What you do get is valuable, actionable insights and a clear plan based on real expertise. The results depend on what you implement.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>How often should I book a consulting session?</summary>
      <p>For most creators, revisiting strategy every 3–6 months makes sense. As your channel evolves, so should your priorities. For ongoing support, consider the coaching program.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>What's the difference between consulting and coaching?</summary>
      <p>Consulting is a focused one-time session — expert advice on your current situation. Coaching is ongoing — weekly feedback, accountability, and support over months. Start with consulting if you're not sure yet.</p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

